From 0c8127843fb7e4c85856042b8eb038d5c962459e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jay Leaton <58495321+jayleaton@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 07:39:56 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] tests: re-pin the serving sources both stacked series changed

The recipe stacks the loader series under the one-GPU series; each
series' own re-pin patch was written against its series alone, so the
two re-pins of gradient-serving.tsv do not apply together. This patch
carries their union: the loader series' three rows and the one-GPU
series' thirteen, every row the hash of the stacked tree's own file.
---
 zig/tests/fixtures/gradient-serving.tsv | 26 ++++++++++++-------------
 1 file changed, 13 insertions(+), 13 deletions(-)

